026-09-29: prompt audit handoff + STATUS\nb402941 RESEARCH.md: Windows vault path\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","session_id":"dd4081c0-a71e-46f2-860a-e83f59d2bc85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"dd4081c0-a71e-46f2-860a-e83f59d2bc85","version":"2.1.287","gitBranch":"main"}
