st drafted in `TypeSafe_Sandbox/docs/VIDEO_SUMMARY_CHECK_PREREG.md` (bars proposed, no calls; `TYPESAFE_API_KEY` saved EMPTY on Windows, needs re-set). Detail: `42Analytics/docs/handoffs/2026-09-30-channel-pipeline.md`."," - 2026-09-30 (Windows, memory/infra audit): Fable audit at `~/.claude/audits/2026-09-30-memory-infra-audit.md`.","   Fixed: the vault was never indexed on Windows (`{VAULT}` token in `KeystoneOS/data/memory-index-paths.json`,"]},{"oldStart":105,"oldLines":7,"newStart":114,"newLines":7,"lines":[" - Write lesson 0002 in RTP_Constraints_Course and import its 122 Myszka references into Zotero."," - Run the next Baylor forecast capture on Wednesday, 2026-09-16."," - Consolidate `USER.md` (95%) and `MEMORY.md` (101%) before the next memory write.","-- Decide whether `RTP_WorkingGroup/RTP_ProgressREPORT/` or the new `RTP_ProgressReport` repo is current.","+- ANSWERED 2026-10-02: Is `RTP_WorkingGroup/RTP_ProgressREPORT/` or the new `RTP_ProgressReport` repo current? The `RTP_ProgressReport` repo is canonical; the old folder is archived (left in place)."," - Confirm that `Ath_Medicine`, `Baylor_Exposure_Data`, and `Risk_Stratification_Engine` contain no identifiable athlete or health data that should remain local-only."," - On the Mac, pull `~/.claude/skills` and run its guarded sync so the Mac-generated views receive the same canonical revision."," "]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/docs/handoffs/2026-10-02-decision-audit.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":59,"lines":["+# Handoff 2026-10-02 — Decision Drain Audit (Windows)","+","+## What and why","+Eric ran a Decision Drain Audit: list 8-20 avoided decisions, sort into four buckets,","+name why they are stuck, plan the next 60 minutes. The list was mined from the last","+month of STATUS files, daily logs and memory (22 found, 20 kept). Then all 11","+\"Ready to Decide Now\" items were decided and recorded, and the process became a skill.","+","+## Decisions (Eric's calls)","+- Dentist (personal): done. Tier A `user_child-dental-plan.md` updated.","+- TypeSafe: MAINTENANCE mode. Router, Zotero classify, R5 verifier kept; no new Jev","+  hunting; exit notes #3, `semantic_find`, `autoresearch` stopped. PR #21 was already merged.","+- OKRs_2026-27: closed (registry status done). The OKR gate (AI buy-in + data governance","+  into an NCAA charter) closes with it. NCAA_BestPractices_Doc untouched.","+- Personal site: scroll-craft build stays LOCAL; the Artifact is the live site.","+- S2_Evaluation: parked on the V1 null; V2 not run.","+- Research in 5 #001: Eric posts v4 as-is, week of 10/5. Readout format settled by PR #7.","+- RTP CLA course-summary verification test: skip unless Joe or staff ask.","+- Flint tensions: mRSI collected daily, Wednesday is the decision read; %1RM/Prilepin kept,","+  stated as projected maxes; COD/FMS gates stay in RTP templates with the owner named","+  (new Tension 18, resolved).","+- PlayerPersonel film review: grading sheet plus a 2-3 line note per player.","+- VALD_Release done; PythonScripts_2024, Education Czar proposals and old","+  `RTP_WorkingGroup/RTP_ProgressREPORT/` archived (recorded only, nothing moved);","+  `RTP_ProgressReport` canonical; CATES 2025 pillars canonical; SpecialRequests history","+  left alone (private repo).","+- forceplate.db: already decided 2026-09-21 (Mac owns GPS, VALD, Perch).","+- Hidden reasons found: built-but-not-shipped; options with no default.","+","+## Files changed (all pushed)","+- `TypeSafe_Sandbox/docs/STATUS.md` (d2d7dd9); `skill_router/expected_skills.{windows,macos}.txt` (3a1b7c5)","+- `project-triage/portfolio.json` (9267a00 OKRs done; dda048d S2 note)","+- STATUS.md in S2_Evaluation 533e4af, Weekly_Research_Review d281b4e, RTP_Constraints_Course","+  6061330, Flint 974b5bb (+ `docs/method-baseline.md`), VALD_Release 5888774,","+  PythonScripts_2024 028c816, Education_Alignment_Initiative fda9ab2, RTP_ProgressReport","+  4d2d4ce, CATES 9b59454 (+ `CLAUDE.md` pillar table), SpecialRequests f1d0d35,","+  PlayerPersonel e353665, DEV root 25d8b08","+- New skill `~/.claude/skills/decision-audit/` (SKILL.md, checklist.md,","+  templates/audit-report.md, references/mining-prompt.md, runs.md) — ea89434","+- Memory: `~/.claude/global-memory/MEMORY.md` (TypeSafe, Personal site, Pending","+  Decisions); Tier A `user_child-dental-plan.md`, `project_personal-site-build-routes.md`","+- `project-triage/.git/worktrees/closeout` stale record removed (folder was read-only).","+","+## Next","+1. Eric: post R5 #001 v4 (dark PDF + teams_v4.md + email_v4.txt), week of 10/5.","+2. Mac: record the personal-site decision in the `Website` repo STATUS (repo is Mac-only).","+3. Mac: `ls ~/DEV | grep -i football` for `baylor-football-analytics`. It is not on GitHub","+   or Windows. If absent, rebuild the scraper/notebook inside SignalPlays and fix the","+   \"code lives in\" lines (SignalPlays STATUS.md, AGENTS.md, docs/project-1.1-big12.md).","+4. Mac: `git pull` in `~/.claude/skills`, then `sync-to-codex.sh`.","+5. Not decided today (other buckets): PP_Recruiting honors benchmark and OL/EDGE targets","+   (need one piece of info); VB GRID merge (Mike), Education_Curriculum and HPI_Protocol","+   plans overdue (receivers); Injury Surveillance A/B/C funding and tech inventory budget","+   group (not Eric's). Sending the tech inventory to Kenny is Eric's.","+","+## Gotchas","+- CATES: the recording agent also rewrote the pillar table's \"Covers\" column; revert if unwanted.","+- Tier B MEMORY.md is at ~2,494 / 2,500 chars. Trim before adding.","+- Re-run `/decision-audit` next month; its `runs.md` tracks whether it earns its slot."]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PROGRAM.md","/Users/kristinarash/DEV/docs/STATUS.md","/Users/kristinarash/DEV/docs/handoffs/2026-10-02-decision-audit.md"]}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c0d88b5c-b039-4a7d-8861-8ec46b3152f8","session_id":"dd4081c0-a71e-46f2-860a-e83f59d2bc85