{"parentUuid":"5d7ae879-ed90-4b59-bc6f-6f654f1565e0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfe3LnzjdBQVqNg6Wx61b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sync is done. Everything is clean.\n\n**First, two jobs failed overnight:**\n- `perch-pull` failed (exit 1). I did not fix it. The log is at `~/DEV/PlayerProfiles_FB_03-28-2026/logs/last_run.json`.\n- `daily-backup` failed because the memory repo was behind. This sync pulled that repo, so the next backup run should pass. The `manifest-unmanaged:42Analytics` error is still open.\n\n**What I did:**\n- DEV root: `~/DEV`.\n- Config, skills and memory: all pulled and pushed.\n- The memory repo got 10 commits from Windows. The newest is \"Closeout 2026-10-02: decision audit session state\".\n- Two daily log files clashed in the memory repo. I kept both sides. Nothing was lost.\n- Memory mirror: 15 projects paired, 0 files copied, 3 files replaced by a newer Windows version.\n- I checked 147 repos. I pulled 16 repos and the `~/DEV` root. All were clean fast merges.\n- I saved and pushed changes that were not committed in 2 repos: `graphify-out` (graph output) and `KeystoneOS` (1 audit file).\n- I cloned 1 missing repo: `SoftwareTech_Review`.\n- I created no repos. I made no `.from-*` files.\n- 27 repos are active. 118 dormant repos are all clean.\n\n**Result: clean.** No repo has open changes or unpushed work.\n\n---\n\n```\nPicking up: TypeSafe_Sandbox\nLast session: 2026-10-02, windows\nWhere things stand: Maintenance mode since today. You keep the skill router, the Zotero classify step and the verifier. You stopped looking for new Jev uses.\nBlocked on: the Mac API key is not verified yet.\nNext: run smoke_test.py on the Mac. Copy the permission-gate hook files to ~/.claude/permission-gate/.\n```\n\nThe rule picks the active repo with the newest commit, so I took TypeSafe. But that commit was only a small router change. Today's real Windows work was the deci